have visited the ship.

35
00:01:42,133 --> 00:01:43,100
- Hi, everybody.

36
00:01:43,100 --> 00:01:44,333
Welcome to Satellite of Love.

37
00:01:44,333 --> 00:01:45,900
When you got a job like ours,

38
00:01:45,900 --> 00:01:48,600
