thought he got a raw deal,

44
00:02:00,767 --> 00:02:02,067
but it's really
none of my business.

45
00:02:02,067 --> 00:02:03,467
Oh, and all those early versions

46
00:02:03,467 --> 00:02:05,267
that were just there
for comic relief.

47
00:02:05,267 --> 00:02:07,500
- And, uh, ED-209,
though I don't know why

48
00:02:07,500 --> 00:02:09,367
they'd make a robot that
can't walk down stairs.

49
00:02:09,367 --> 00:02:11,233
- And God bless Cherry 3000.

50
00:02:11,233 --> 00:02:13,533
- Oh yeah, and God
bless Galaxina.

51
00:02:13,533 --> 00:02:14,533
Yeah.

52
00:02:14,533 --> 00:02:15,367
- Okay, and who else?

53
00:02:15,367 --> 00:02:16,600
- Oh.

54
00:02:16,600 --> 00:02:17,400
- Do we have to?
- I don't want to.

55
