- Yes, yeah you have to.

56
00:02:18,200 --> 00:02:19,533
- Okay.

57
00:02:19,533 --> 00:02:20,967
- [Crow And Tom]
God bless T wiki.

58
00:02:20,967 --> 00:02:22,967
