122
00:04:26,167 --> 00:04:27,433
(laughter)

123
00:04:27,433 --> 00:04:28,633
- Okay, 'kay, 'kay, cut it out.

124
00:04:28,633 --> 00:04:29,967
- And then if you
really wanna have some

125
00:04:29,967 --> 00:04:32,867
big blast of ballistic hilarity,

126
00:04:32,867 --> 00:04:34,667
there's the Merth
Mortar, let me show ya.

127
00:04:34,667 --> 00:04:35,533
- Uh-oh.

128
00:04:36,700 --> 00:04:38,000
- Brace yourself,
head for cover.

129
00:04:38,000 --> 00:04:38,967
- Okay, smile.

130
00:04:40,067 --> 00:04:41,967
(screaming with
pleasure and laughing)

131
00:04:41,967 --> 00:04:43,867
What do you think?

132
00:04:43,867 --> 00:04:45,567
- That is so neat.

133
00:04:45,567 --> 00:04:47,267
We could base a whole
party around that.

134
00:04:47,267 --> 00:04:49,333
We could all get in
our fuzzy feety pajamas

135
00:04:49,333 --> 00:04:51,267
