dance on your grave.

138
00:04:54,267 --> 00:04:55,367
- Oh, will I be invited?

139
00:04:55,367 --> 00:04:56,933
- You'll be the guest of honor.

140
00:04:56,933 --> 00:04:57,867
(laughing)

141
00:04:57,867 --> 00:04:58,900
Now, tell them about the movie.

142
00:04:58,900 --> 00:04:59,933
I gotta get out of this thing.

143
00:04:59,933 --> 00:05:01,533
I'm chaffing like a bear.

144
00:05:01,533 --> 00:05:04,800
- Well, Joel, this week's
movie is called Catalina Caper,

145
00:05:04,800 --> 00:05:07,700
