146
00:05:07,700 --> 00:05:10,667
It's a veritable feel good
movie, a lighthearted romp.

147
00:05:10,667 --> 00:05:13,133
A triumph of the human spirit!

148
00:05:13,133 --> 00:05:16,267
Thank you, Tommy
Kirk, for making us

149
00:05:16,267 --> 00:05:18,300
