150
00:05:18,300 --> 00:05:19,800
Again.

151
00:05:19,800 --> 00:05:21,333
And it's got a great theme song.

152
00:05:21,333 --> 00:05:22,600
You're gonna love it.

153
00:05:22,600 --> 00:05:23,767
♪ Never ever ever
steal anything wet ♪

154
00:05:23,767 --> 00:05:26,133
- [Dr Forester] Frank, incoming!

155
00:05:26,133 --> 00:05:28,467
(explosion)

156
00:05:30,400 --> 00:05:32,067
(shouting and laughing)
(alarm sounding)

157
00:05:32,067 --> 00:05:34,600
