159
00:05:46,433 --> 00:05:48,867
(laughing and giggling)

160
00:05:48,867 --> 00:05:50,700
- [Joel] That was funny.

161
00:05:50,700 --> 00:05:54,333
- [Crow] (sighs) Oh,
oh fun, that was fun.

162
00:05:54,333 --> 00:05:55,633
- [Tom] Yeah, great fun.

163
00:05:55,633 --> 00:05:56,700
- [Joel] Huh, what gives?

164
00:05:56,700 --> 00:05:57,700
- [Tom] Hmm?

165
00:06:00,200 --> 00:06:02,167
- [Tom And Crow] Huh.

166
00:06:02,167 --> 00:06:03,467
