172
00:06:14,300 --> 00:06:19,300
("Never steal anything
wet" by Carol Connors)

173
00:06:21,233 --> 00:06:22,700
- [Tom] So, what's in the can?

174
00:06:22,700 --> 00:06:25,100
- [Joel] I think it's,
uh, dehydrated water.

175
00:06:25,100 --> 00:06:25,933
- [Tom] Oh

176
00:06:28,133 --> 00:06:29,800
- [Crow] Oh, a scuba film.

177
00:06:29,800 --> 00:06:32,367
- [Joel] Hmm, Jacques Cousteau
meets the Pink Panther.

178
00:06:35,433 --> 00:06:36,667
- [Crow] By this time, my--

179
00:06:36,667 --> 00:06:37,600
- [Joel] Hey, come on, just..

180
00:06:37,600 --> 00:06:38,600
- [Crow] Huh?

181
00:06:38,600 --> 00:06:39,633
You know just lay off.

182
00:06:39,633 --> 00:06:40,900
Okay, sorry.

183
00:06:40,900 --> 00:06:42,133
- [Tom] So what's
a Catalina Caper?

184
00:06:42,133 --> 00:06:43,367
- [Joel] It's one of
those little balls

185
00:06:43,367 --> 00:06:44,933
