peel and eat shrimp.

186
00:06:44,933 --> 00:06:46,200
- [Tom] Oh.

187
00:06:46,200 --> 00:06:47,933
Sorry, Charlie, only the
best titles are picked.

188
00:06:47,933 --> 00:06:50,467
- [Crow] Starring Tommy Kirk.

189
00:06:50,467 --> 00:06:52,700
