of Venita Wolf anyway?

201
00:07:29,200 --> 00:07:31,833
(laughing)

202
00:07:31,833 --> 00:07:34,533
- [Crow] Charlie, they
cut off my thumbs.

203
00:07:35,967 --> 00:07:38,133
