a trick on that fish.

208
00:07:50,467 --> 00:07:53,100
Oh yeah, feel good about
kickin' a fish's butt.

209
00:07:53,100 --> 00:07:54,900
That's real nice.

210
00:07:54,900 --> 00:07:57,100
(humming)

211
00:08:02,367 --> 00:08:04,700
- [Tom] Hmm, screenplay
written in crayon.

212
00:08:04,700 --> 00:08:06,033
