- [Tom, Joel , Crow] Burn
the witch, burn the witch!

229
00:08:53,833 --> 00:08:56,733
We shall cleanse
the earth with fire.

230
00:08:57,933 --> 00:08:59,200
- [Crow] How do you
know she's a witch?

231
00:08:59,200 --> 00:09:00,500
- [Tom] Oh, these
Klan meetings have

232
00:09:00,500 --> 00:09:02,000
