what I call art.

234
00:09:03,867 --> 00:09:06,033
Scantily clad women and a
"Huey Lewis and the News"

235
00:09:06,033 --> 00:09:07,800
sound on the radio.

236
00:09:07,800 --> 00:09:10,033
This is the kinda padding
I like to see in a film!

237
00:09:10,033 --> 00:09:12,233
- [Tom] Throw another
Beach Boy on the fire.

238
00:09:14,667 --> 00:09:15,500
Wow.

239
00:09:16,833 --> 00:09:18,967
- [Crow] And so the
Aryan youth dance around

240
00:09:18,967 --> 00:09:20,067
