241
00:09:21,200 --> 00:09:22,900
- [Joel] You know, this
is really good sound

242
00:09:22,900 --> 00:09:24,533
and it was before Dolby.

243
00:09:24,533 --> 00:09:25,900
- [Tom] Dolby Gillis?

244
00:09:25,900 --> 00:09:26,767
- [Joel] I dunno.

245
00:09:28,200 --> 00:09:29,700
- [Crow] Meanwhile, in the
dark, impenetrable void,

246
00:09:29,700 --> 00:09:31,733
John-Paul Sartre was
a-movin' and a-groovin'.

247
00:09:31,733 --> 00:09:33,000
- [Tom] No exit, baby.

248
00:09:34,367 --> 00:09:37,333
- [Joel] Oh, looks like
they're in the Night Gallery.

249
00:09:37,333 --> 00:09:40,333
- [Crow] This portrait, a
man who smokes more than

250
00:09:40,333 --> 00:09:42,200
Edward R. Murrow
or Lillian Hellman.

251
00:09:43,900 --> 00:09:45,900
