- Whatever it was,
it sure must've

2241
01:19:29,833 --> 01:19:31,067
been worth a lot of breaths.

2242
01:19:31,067 --> 01:19:32,667
- I knew you were
up to something.

2243
01:19:32,667 --> 01:19:34,267
I wanna know,
what's it all about?

2244
01:19:34,267 --> 01:19:35,133
- [Joel] Alfie.

2245
01:19:35,133 --> 01:19:36,500
- Fighting?

2246
01:19:36,500 --> 01:19:38,267
- I'd like an explanation
too, Mr. Duval.

2247
01:19:38,267 --> 01:19:40,567
I mean this is the second
time in the last few days

2248
01:19:40,567 --> 01:19:41,767
