2249
01:19:41,767 --> 01:19:43,667
- [Crow] Yeah, and lots
of other stuff too.

2250
01:19:43,667 --> 01:19:44,600
- Maybe if you take us
back to Avalon, son.

2251
01:19:44,600 --> 01:19:45,567
I'll explain a little later.

2252
01:19:49,100 --> 01:19:52,267
- Will you put your
hands down, Lawrence.

2253
01:19:52,267 --> 01:19:53,900
- [Tom] D'oh!, I don't
wanna play patty cake.

2254
01:19:53,900 --> 01:19:55,433
- Well, we really
shouldn't feel too badly.

2255
01:19:55,433 --> 01:19:57,500
The fates were against us.

2256
01:19:57,500 --> 01:19:59,500
- And it cost us
half a million bucks.

2257
01:20:01,600 --> 01:20:04,433
- [Joel] You know, I don't
think I wanna live in a world

2258
01:20:04,433 --> 01:20:06,333
