2259
01:20:06,333 --> 01:20:07,633
Nothin's right.

2260
01:20:07,633 --> 01:20:09,367
- [Tom] You're hurting.

2261
01:20:09,367 --> 01:20:11,067
- Yeah, that's
what I'm afraid of.

2262
01:20:15,100 --> 01:20:16,767
- There's always the chance
of the police tracing

2263
