the stolen scroll
back to my folks.

2264
01:20:18,800 --> 01:20:20,733
- Are you sure this
is a real scroll?

2265
01:20:20,733 --> 01:20:22,467
- [Tom] Hey, who's
to say what's real

2266
01:20:22,467 --> 01:20:23,700
and what's not real, man?

2267
01:20:23,700 --> 01:20:25,600
- And besides, we heard
Dad talking about it.

2268
01:20:25,600 --> 01:20:28,000
- [Crow] We can thank the
screenwriter for that.

2269
01:20:29,100 --> 01:20:30,200
- The scroll we thought
we were diving for

2270
01:20:30,200 --> 01:20:31,467
was a phoney.

2271
01:20:31,467 --> 01:20:32,700
- I just got a flash.

2272
01:20:32,700 --> 01:20:33,700
- [Tom] A hot flash.

2273
01:20:33,700 --> 01:20:35,400
Whose going through menopause?

2274
01:20:35,400 --> 01:20:36,667
- Once they find out
that they've got the
wrong merchandise,

2275
01:20:36,667 --> 01:20:38,200
man, they're gonna
be out for blood.

2276
01:20:38,200 --> 01:20:39,667
- [Joel] Man, everything's
comin' down on me today.

2277
01:20:39,667 --> 01:20:41,633
- Let's unload the hot
potato on the fuzz.

2278
01:20:41,633 --> 01:20:43,200
- Cool it!

2279
01:20:43,200 --> 01:20:44,733
Get the fuzz into this and
his folks end up in jail.

2280
01:20:44,733 --> 01:20:46,367
- [Crow] I can't use
this lingo anymore.

2281
01:20:46,367 --> 01:20:49,867
- [Joel] He's
totally psycypolis.

2282
01:20:49,867 --> 01:20:51,333
- Be my guest.

2283
01:20:51,333 --> 01:20:52,967
I haven't got the blood to
spare for those folks of yours.

2284
01:20:52,967 --> 01:20:53,800
- [Tom] You got the hair for it.

2285
01:20:53,800 --> 01:20:54,833
- That's no good.

2286
01:20:54,833 --> 01:20:56,133
The minute dad gets it back,

2287
01:20:56,133 --> 01:20:57,800
the temptation will
be too much for 'em.

2288
01:20:57,800 --> 01:20:59,200
- [Tom] And the Four
Tops and the Spinners.

2289
01:21:00,933 --> 01:21:02,933
- From my breath you shoulda
left it where you threw it,

2290
01:21:02,933 --> 01:21:04,467
instead of going back
to dive for it later.

2291
01:21:04,467 --> 01:21:06,267
- [Crow] Please, I implore you.

2292
01:21:06,267 --> 01:21:07,567
Shut up!

2293
01:21:07,567 --> 01:21:09,167
- I have no right to say this.

2294
01:21:09,167 --> 01:21:10,433
- [Joel] God, your
hair smells good.

2295
01:21:10,433 --> 01:21:13,733
- I know a way to scare
the larceny out of your

2296
01:21:13,733 --> 01:21:14,967
folks once and for all.

2297
01:21:14,967 --> 01:21:16,167
