2298
01:21:16,167 --> 01:21:17,600
- And get Angelo
and Borman arrested.

2299
01:21:17,600 --> 01:21:19,400
- I'm ready to try anything
as long as it doesn't

2300
01:21:19,400 --> 01:21:21,200
