Dad with the police.

2301
01:21:21,200 --> 01:21:22,433
- [Crow] Or farm animals.

2302
01:21:22,433 --> 01:21:23,667
- We know they would
want the real scroll.

2303
01:21:23,667 --> 01:21:25,600
What we've gotta do is
make sure that they know

2304
01:21:25,600 --> 01:21:27,233
that we've got it.

2305
01:21:27,233 --> 01:21:28,467
- I'm not about to
have them take out

2306
01:21:28,467 --> 01:21:29,800
their frustrations on me!

2307
01:21:29,800 --> 01:21:30,800
- [All] Oh, shut up!

2308
01:21:31,767 --> 01:21:33,533
- And lose my image?

2309
01:21:33,533 --> 01:21:34,567
- [Tom] What image?

2310
01:21:34,567 --> 01:21:35,500
- What's the play?

2311
01:21:35,500 --> 01:21:36,700
- [Joel] Ah, it's Twelfth Night.

2312
01:21:36,700 --> 01:21:38,900
- We try and smoke
out Angelo and Borman.

2313
01:21:38,900 --> 01:21:40,700
Bound to be around
here someplace.

2314
01:21:40,700 --> 01:21:43,067
Let's find Tina and
some of the kids.

2315
01:21:43,067 --> 01:21:45,233
- [Crow] These kids today
with their loud music

2316
01:21:45,233 --> 01:21:47,133
and hula hoops and
fax machines...

2317
01:21:47,133 --> 01:21:48,167
I don't know.

2318
01:21:49,600 --> 01:21:51,133
For those of you following
along in the Syd Field

2319
01:21:51,133 --> 01:21:53,367
Screenplay workbook, that
last scene was the plot point,

2320
01:21:53,367 --> 01:21:54,533
