2321
01:21:54,533 --> 01:21:56,167
Now this.

2322
01:21:56,167 --> 01:21:57,100
- [Tom] Mayberry.

2323
01:21:57,100 --> 01:21:59,000
After Hours.

2324
01:21:59,000 --> 01:22:01,367
- [Crow] No shirt,
no shoes, no script.

2325
01:22:01,367 --> 01:22:02,833
(laughing)

2326
01:22:02,833 --> 01:22:03,800
- [Joel] Okay.

2327
01:22:03,800 --> 01:22:05,300
Hello Muddah, hello Fadduh.

2328
01:22:05,300 --> 01:22:08,233
Here I am at, uh, Catalina.

2329
01:22:08,233 --> 01:22:11,233
(suspenseful music)

2330
01:22:16,233 --> 01:22:18,400
- [Tom] Zack Norman is
Sammy in Chief Zabu.

2331
01:22:21,967 --> 01:22:22,967
- [Crow] Uh-oh.

2332
01:22:22,967 --> 01:22:25,133
- [Joel] It's the big guy.

2333
01:22:25,133 --> 01:22:28,133
(suspenseful music)

2334
01:22:29,633 --> 01:22:32,700
- [Crow] I have to sit like
this since the implant.

2335
01:22:34,033 --> 01:22:36,000
- [Joel] I'm watching
you, crayon-head.

2336
01:22:37,433 --> 01:22:38,833
- [Tom and Joel] Ouch, oi,
ouch, ow, hot, hot, hot.

2337
01:22:38,833 --> 01:22:40,900
Asphalt, oh, oh, hot hot.

2338
01:22:44,533 --> 01:22:45,467
- Any luck?

2339
01:22:45,467 --> 01:22:46,467
- Nothing.

2340
01:22:46,467 --> 01:22:47,300
Here come the bunnies.

2341
01:22:47,300 --> 01:22:48,467
Maybe they did better.

2342
01:22:48,467 --> 01:22:49,967
- [Joel] Hoppin'
down the bunny trail.

2343
01:22:49,967 --> 01:22:50,633
- [Crow] Hey, it's Charlie's
Angels, plus a smart one.

2344
01:22:50,633 --> 01:22:51,933
- Nobody.

2345
01:22:51,933 --> 01:22:53,400
At least not anybody
who looks like the

2346
01:22:53,400 --> 01:22:55,133
