2347
01:22:55,133 --> 01:22:56,200
- Keep looking.

2348
01:22:56,200 --> 01:22:57,733
- Move out, crew.

2349
01:22:57,733 --> 01:22:59,000
- [Joel] Oh it's McMillan
and wife and wife and wife.

2350
01:22:59,000 --> 01:23:00,667
- Don, can I talk
to you a minute?

2351
01:23:00,667 --> 01:23:01,700
- What?

2352
01:23:01,700 --> 01:23:03,267
- Huck, just a minute.

2353
01:23:03,267 --> 01:23:04,100
- We gotta go.

2354
01:23:04,100 --> 01:23:05,400
What's wrong?

2355
01:23:05,400 --> 01:23:06,400
- [Tom] I'm pregnant.

2356
01:23:06,400 --> 01:23:08,733
I'm sorry I slapped you.

2357
01:23:08,733 --> 01:23:10,400
And I wasn't really
drowning either.

2358
01:23:10,400 --> 01:23:12,100
