got a groovy sister.

2365
01:23:23,500 --> 01:23:24,600
And you know who else thinks so?

2366
01:23:24,600 --> 01:23:26,200
- [Joel] The football team?

2367
01:23:26,200 --> 01:23:27,233
- Tad.

2368
01:23:27,233 --> 01:23:29,133
