2371
01:23:36,567 --> 01:23:38,867
- Go find Charlie, quick!

2372
01:23:38,867 --> 01:23:39,800
- [Tom] Right now.

2373
01:23:39,800 --> 01:23:41,367
- [Joel] Hey Charlie.

2374
01:23:41,367 --> 01:23:42,800
I take 'em on, I know
I can, I'll do it.

2375
01:23:42,800 --> 01:23:44,400
I will, I will, I will.

2376
01:23:44,400 --> 01:23:47,400
