2377
01:23:49,800 --> 01:23:53,933
(suspenseful orchestra music)

2378
01:23:53,933 --> 01:23:55,900
(humming)

2379
01:23:55,900 --> 01:23:57,067
- [Crow] Hmm, lucky.

2380
01:23:57,067 --> 01:23:57,900
Open table.

2381
01:23:58,800 --> 01:24:02,567
(suspenseful orchestra music)

2382
01:24:06,300 --> 01:24:08,300
- [Joel] How come he
got a menu already?

2383
01:24:09,233 --> 01:24:11,000
- [Tom] Lucky.

2384
01:24:11,000 --> 01:24:11,933
(spurt)

2385
01:24:11,933 --> 01:24:13,167
- [Tom] Oh peach daiquiri.

2386
01:24:13,167 --> 01:24:14,600
So that's what I
drank last night.

2387
01:24:16,600 --> 01:24:18,233
- [Crow} Nice Bit Tank, Dude.

2388
01:24:21,300 --> 01:24:22,767
(suspenseful violin music)

2389
01:24:22,767 --> 01:24:24,433
