for my spinach omelet.

2390
01:24:24,433 --> 01:24:26,800
- And no slip-up this time.

2391
01:24:31,100 --> 01:24:32,033
- Hi.

2392
01:24:32,033 --> 01:24:33,433
- [Joel] Yes I am, and you?

2393
01:24:33,433 --> 01:24:34,833
- I've been looking for you.

2394
01:24:34,833 --> 01:24:36,000
- [Tom] Creepy Girl!

2395
01:24:36,000 --> 01:24:38,233
- Don't make any heroic
moves, my friend.

2396
01:24:38,233 --> 01:24:39,600
- [Tom] It's too late
to rewrite the script!

2397
01:24:39,600 --> 01:24:41,067
- Hand it over.

2398
01:24:42,233 --> 01:24:43,833
- Angelo, what are
you doing here?

2399
01:24:43,833 --> 01:24:45,133
- [Crow] Workin', bein' evil.

2400
01:24:45,133 --> 01:24:46,200
Shut up!

2401
01:24:46,200 --> 01:24:47,467
- I don't have time for games.

2402
01:24:47,467 --> 01:24:49,133
- [Tom] And I haven't
got time for the pain.

2403
01:24:50,167 --> 01:24:51,633
- Angelo!

2404
01:24:51,633 --> 01:24:53,533
- [Joel] Man, everybody's
comin' down on Angelo.

2405
01:24:53,533 --> 01:24:57,033
(suspenseful cello music)

2406
01:24:58,400 --> 01:24:59,400
- Thank you.

2407
01:25:01,300 --> 01:25:03,267
- [Tom] Creep.

2408
01:25:03,267 --> 01:25:05,367
(suspenseful orchestra music)

2409
01:25:05,367 --> 01:25:06,867
- [Joel] After him, team gang!

2410
01:25:06,867 --> 01:25:09,400
(laughing)

2411
01:25:09,400 --> 01:25:11,000
- [Tom] D'oh!, ooh!

2412
01:25:12,333 --> 01:25:14,433
When you're a Jet,
you're a Jet all the way.

2413
01:25:15,333 --> 01:25:16,533
- Splendid, son.

2414
01:25:16,533 --> 01:25:17,400
- [Crow] It's a
Catalina Army Knife.

2415
01:25:17,400 --> 01:25:18,400
- Always be prepared.

2416
01:25:18,400 --> 01:25:19,867
- [Joel] And effeminate.

2417
01:25:19,867 --> 01:25:21,000
We'll take care of the
garbage, go get 'em, Don..

2418
01:25:22,167 --> 01:25:23,800
- Can you handle
this for Mr Duval?

2419
01:25:23,800 --> 01:25:25,033
- [Joel] It's land fuzz.

2420
01:25:25,033 --> 01:25:26,267
- [Tom] Some call
them land pigs.

2421
01:25:26,267 --> 01:25:28,667
- You Bunnies stay here.

2422
01:25:28,667 --> 01:25:30,200
Duty calls your master away.

2423
01:25:32,700 --> 01:25:34,200
- [Crow] What do
you mean by that?

2424
01:25:34,200 --> 01:25:35,167
- [Tom] Okay people.

2425
01:25:35,167 --> 01:25:36,800
Everybody wear eye protection.

2426
01:25:36,800 --> 01:25:38,767
There's a lotta loose
ends flyin' together
all at once here.

2427
01:25:38,767 --> 01:25:41,100
- [Crow] Wow, this Main
Street U.S.A. parade

2428
01:25:41,100 --> 01:25:42,300
