2429
01:25:42,300 --> 01:25:43,967
- [Tom] Oh, hi folks!

2430
01:25:43,967 --> 01:25:47,067
- [Crow] That's not
Mickey, that's Nicky.

2431
01:25:47,067 --> 01:25:48,933
- [Joel] Hey, he's running
into the haunted mansion, ooh.

2432
01:25:50,833 --> 01:25:53,900
- [Tom] I'm your ghost host.

2433
01:25:53,900 --> 01:25:57,567
- [All] Ouwie, ouch,
ouch, ouch, owie, ouch.

2434
01:26:00,400 --> 01:26:02,533
- [Crow] Pratfall anyone?

2435
01:26:02,533 --> 01:26:04,633
Pratfall, I got 'em all.

2436
01:26:04,633 --> 01:26:08,300
- [All] Ouwie, ouch,
ouch, ouch, owie, ouch.

2437
01:26:09,767 --> 01:26:11,233
- [Crow] Hmmmm, no
exit through there.

2438
01:26:11,233 --> 01:26:12,500
- [Tom] All right,
come on, come on!

2439
01:26:13,767 --> 01:26:16,033
(punching)

2440
01:26:19,800 --> 01:26:22,967
(incoherent babbling)

2441
01:26:24,333 --> 01:26:26,733
- [Joel] Don't snag on
me, don't snag on me!

2442
01:26:26,733 --> 01:26:28,133
- [Tom] Eat it, boy, eat it!

2443
01:26:30,467 --> 01:26:31,900
- [All] Oh no!

2444
01:26:31,900 --> 01:26:35,067
(incoherent babbling)

2445
01:26:37,100 --> 01:26:39,233
- [All] Woooooowwww.

2446
01:26:39,233 --> 01:26:41,433
(splash)

2447
01:26:41,433 --> 01:26:43,100
(mimicking incoherent
babbling under water)

2448
01:26:43,100 --> 01:26:44,267
- [Crow] You got
me all wet, boy.

2449
01:26:45,700 --> 01:26:47,300
- [Tom] Well, I guess he's
swimming back to Greece.

2450
01:26:47,300 --> 01:26:50,700
(suspenseful orchestra music)

2451
01:26:50,700 --> 01:26:52,100
- [Joel] A little
late, aren't you buddy?

2452
01:26:55,800 --> 01:26:57,000
- [Joel] Take a rest, friend.

2453
01:26:57,000 --> 01:26:59,167
You've provided
enough comic relief.

2454
01:26:59,167 --> 01:27:00,767
Thank you, Corky
the Water Clown,

2455
01:27:00,767 --> 01:27:02,900
