2456
01:27:02,900 --> 01:27:04,067
Again.

2457
01:27:04,067 --> 01:27:05,333
- What do you
think you're doing?

2458
01:27:05,333 --> 01:27:07,800
- I've got you this time, Duval.

2459
01:27:07,800 --> 01:27:10,100
