silly things off my wrist?

2460
01:27:10,100 --> 01:27:11,567
- [Crow] I'm the silly thing.

2461
01:27:11,567 --> 01:27:12,567
- I've waited a long time
for you to make a slip

2462
01:27:12,567 --> 01:27:14,000
