- [Tom] F.B.I,
Pratfall Division.

2467
01:27:19,400 --> 01:27:21,367
- And what's the charge?

2468
01:27:21,367 --> 01:27:23,300
- Grand theft.

2469
01:27:23,300 --> 01:27:25,067
