what you're talking about.

2471
01:27:26,600 --> 01:27:29,400
- You stole the scroll
from the collection.

2472
01:27:29,400 --> 01:27:31,133
And it's in that
case you're holding..

2473
01:27:31,133 --> 01:27:33,800
- [Joel] Oh wow,
he's holdin', dude.

2474
01:27:38,733 --> 01:27:40,800
- [Tom] Hey cool,
a Bon Jovi poster!

2475
01:27:40,800 --> 01:27:42,533
- [Joel] Kinda like a
pea shooter, isn't it?

2476
01:27:42,533 --> 01:27:43,833
- [Tom] Good one.

2477
01:27:43,833 --> 01:27:44,667
- It's gone!

2478
01:27:44,667 --> 01:27:45,900
- [Crow] My career!

2479
01:27:45,900 --> 01:27:47,533
- It was in there, I
know it was in there.

2480
01:27:48,733 --> 01:27:49,667
- [Joel] Why me?

2481
01:27:49,667 --> 01:27:50,733
Why me all the time?

2482
01:27:50,733 --> 01:27:51,633
- Where did it go?

2483
01:27:53,633 --> 01:27:55,633
